"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` invokes `registerPantokenElements()` (from `@pantoken/"
"angular`) once at bootstrap so\n"
"  elements like `<instui-icon>` render in templates, and it imports the "
"token/component CSS plus\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (enables modal, tooltip, and other component "
"behaviors).\n"
"- `src/app.component.ts` is a self-contained component "
